{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14106320","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14106320","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1410632001:0":{"text":"그래, 여기가 바로 드래곤의 알들을 운반하는 구역이었어. 어쩐지 그 녀석이 여길 지키고 있더라니...","source_cn":"原来如此，这里是龙蛋的运输区啊。怪不得会有那个小家伙守着……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3307E9D68D2CC7FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1410632002:0":{"text":"내 생각엔 침입자가 없을 때엔, 저 기계가 이곳의 운송 선로를 지키는 것 같아.","source_cn":"我估计没有入侵者的时候，它负责维护这里的运输轨道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04B38E3EFA700FFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410632003:0":{"text":"이 선로가 어디서부터 시작되는지 알아봐야겠습니다.","source_cn":"我要知道这条轨道的源头是什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E5159CEC146E08B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410632004:0":{"text":"드래곤의 알이 깊은 곳에서 운반되어 오는 것이라면, 아마 드래곤은 바로 그곳에 있을 겁니다.","source_cn":"既然龙蛋都是从深处运出来的，龙可能就在那里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A9439180A2CA4CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410632005:0":{"text":"맞는 말이야! 그게 용암 호수라고 해도 어떻게든 건너가야지!","source_cn":"你说得没错！就算是熔岩湖，我们也得想法子过去了。势在必行！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88F4366145F3D940","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"조아","source":"祖娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:因度厄":{"text":"인듀어","source":"因度厄","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":6,"localized_text_count":5,"speaker_count":2}}